#: ../../source/docs/savetrim.rst:5 c41fd362bc4f4f2587fb8103594931dd
msgid "Save Steering Trim"
msgstr "保存转向微调"

#: ../../source/docs/savetrim.rst:7 f12caa5bc63d4658a8fe5f1eaa304d81
msgid ""
"If the vehicle does not track straight in ``MANUAL`` mode with steering at "
"neutral, you can either adjust the steering mechanics to correct, or use the"
" ``RCx_OPTION`` =  5 (Save Trim) to correct. Using the steering channel's "
"trim tab or sub-trim in the transmitter is not recommended (after RC "
"calibration is completed), since it will appear as a constant pilot steering"
" request in non-MANUAL modes."
msgstr ""
"如果车辆在 ``MANUAL`` 模式下方向舵处于中立位置时无法直线行驶，您可以调整转向机构来修正，或使用 ``RCx_OPTION`` = "
"5（Save Trim）来修正。不建议使用发射机中转向通道的微调或副微调（RC校准完成后），因为在非 MANUAL 模式下这会被视为飞手的持续转向输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/savetrim.rst:10 730882bb5c674be7973423a3a66e2d48
msgid "Save Trim"
msgstr "保存微调"

#: ../../source/docs/savetrim.rst:12 3a10c9810d7a423b9265b13afeccb61a
msgid ""
"Activating Save Trim on the channel with RCx_OPTION = 5, will instantly "
"capture the current output of the Steering Channel servo (normally SERVO1) "
"and store it as its SERVOx_TRIM value. This can be repeated by de-activating"
" and re-activating the rc channel function. The output is saved only at the "
"moment of activation. It can be used in any mode except ``LOITER`` or "
"``HOLD``."
msgstr ""
"在设置了 RCx_OPTION = 5 的通道上激活 Save Trim，将立即捕获转向通道舵机（通常为 SERVO1）的当前输出，并将其存储为 "
"SERVOx_TRIM 值。可以通过取消激活再重新激活该 RC 通道功能来重复此操作。输出仅在激活时刻保存。此功能可在除 ``LOITER`` 或 "
"``HOLD`` 以外的任何模式下使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/savetrim.rst:14 7f271985ef614e1a95839952a83c1cf8
msgid ""
"This is best used in ``ACRO`` mode when the autopilot is maintaining "
"heading. Autonomous modes like ``AUTO`` or ``RTL``, may capture the output "
"during a maneuver to turn to a waypoint, crosstrack correct, or be loitering"
" at the end, and store incorrect results. But it can be used if careful as "
"to when its applied. It can also be used during ``MANUAL`` mode by trimming "
"at the transmitter for straight track, activating, and then returning the "
"trim to center."
msgstr ""
"最好在飞控保持航向时在 ``ACRO`` 模式下使用。像 ``AUTO`` 或 ``RTL`` "
"这样的自主模式可能在转向至某航点、横迹修正或在终点悬停时捕获输出，导致存储结果不正确。但如果仔细选择使用时机，也可在这些模式下使用。也可在 "
"``MANUAL`` 模式下使用，先在发射机上调整微调使车辆直行，激活后再将微调返回中立。"
